    "slug": "playground-website-killing-sales",
    "excerpt": "Your $200K inclusive playground system looks like a McDonald's PlayPlace on your website — and that's exactly why the architect spec'd your competitor instead.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI",
    "published_at": "2026-04-12T15:19:54.231+00:00",
