    "excerpt": "Discover how Evansville logistics firms are gaining massive competitive advantages with AI. Learn to streamline operations, cut costs, and dominate the Indiana supply chain market.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-04-08T11:00:25.877+00:00",
