    "excerpt": "Discover how Noblesville agribusinesses are gaining a massive edge using AI automation. Learn to optimize yields and reduce costs with local Indiana AI solutions.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-27T11:00:29.212+00:00",
