    "slug": "digital-transformation-for-indianapolis-healthcare-providers-2026-03-26",
    "excerpt": "Discover how Indianapolis healthcare providers are leveraging AI automation and digital transformation to improve patient outcomes, reduce burnout, and streamline operations in Indiana.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-26T11:00:36.634+00:00",
