    "excerpt": "Discover how voice AI solutions in Muncie, Indiana are revolutionizing the legal industry. Learn how local firms use AI automation to streamline intake and boost productivity.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-23T11:00:35.59+00:00",
