    "excerpt": "Is your finance team spending 20 hours a week on manual reports CRM could automate in 2 minutes? You're flushing money down the drain. Discover the hidden costs and learn why your current strategy is failing.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T19:07:44.082+00:00",
