    "excerpt": "Your customer service team is drowning in repetitive questions. If your team does THIS, you're leaving hundreds of thousands on the table. Discover how to fix it and save a fortune.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T19:07:18.148+00:00",
