    "excerpt": "I analyzed 50+ companies. Their in-house teams cost a fortune, yet often underperform compared to specialized external partners. Here's the uncomfortable truth backed by receipts. Are you making this $350,000 mistake?",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T19:06:22.319+00:00",
