    "slug": "crm-graveyard-sales-crisis",
    "excerpt": "75% of CRM implementations fail, costing companies millions. Your sales team isn't refusing your CRM because they're lazy; they're reacting to a broken system. Uncover the hidden costs of disconnected sales. Read more...",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T19:05:23.212+00:00",
