    "id": "e5dd9dd7-08ac-4f7d-8802-8acae913e518",
    "title": "Your CRM is a Graveyard. Revive it.",
    "slug": "crm-graveyard-revive-it",
    "excerpt": "50,000 contacts. Zero clarity. Your CRM could be costing you millions. Discover how to transform it from a data graveyard into a revenue engine. The waste is staggering. 🚨",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T18:27:40.102+00:00",
