    "excerpt": "Discover how Fishers, Indiana education businesses are gaining a competitive edge using AI. Learn actionable strategies for automation, student engagement, and operational efficiency.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-20T11:00:29.789+00:00",
