    "title": "Accounting: Your LinkedIn Post Isn't a Strategy. It's a Symptom.",
    "slug": "accounting-linkedin-post-not-strategy",
    "excerpt": "I analyzed 50+ accounting firms' marketing. The grim reality? Most are operating with a 'strategy' that's actively bleeding leads and profits. Are you making their #1 mistake?",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
    "published_at": "2026-03-19T21:29:50.299+00:00",
