    "excerpt": "Is your accounting firm mistaking a 'LinkedIn presence' for a growth strategy? You're likely hemorrhaging money. Discover how disconnected digital efforts are costing you millions and what a real marketing ecosystem looks like.",
    "author": "Aetheris AI Team",
